头汗出剂颈而还腹满微喘口干咽烂或不大便久则谵语甚者至哕手足躁扰捻衣摸床小便利者其人可治\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e一二四：「太阳病」，中风，以火劫发汗，邪风被火热，血气流溢，失其常度，两阳相熏灼，其身发黄。阳盛则欲衄，阴虚小便难，阴阳俱虚竭，身体则枯燥，但头汗出，剂颈而还。腹满、微喘、口干、咽烂，或不大便，久则谵语，甚者至「哕」，手足躁扰，捻衣摸床；小便利者，其人可治。\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%80%e4%ba%8c%e5%9b%9b%e5%a4%aa%e9%98%b3%e7%97%85%e4%b8%ad%e9%a3%8e%e4%bb%a5%e7%81%ab%e5%8a%ab%e5%8f%91%e6%b1%97%e9%82%aa%e9%a3%8e%e8%a2%ab%e7%81%ab%e7%83%ad%e8%a1%80%e6%b0%94%e6%b5%81%e6%ba%a2%e5%a4%b1%e5%85%b6%e5%b8%b8%e5%ba%a6%e4%b8%a4%e9%98%b3%e7%9b%b8%e7%86%8f%e7%81%bc%e5%85%b6%e8%ba%ab%e5%8f%91%e9%bb%84%e9%98%b3%e7%9b%9b%e5%88%99%e6%ac%b2%e8%a1%84%e9%98%b4%e8%99%9a%e5%b0%8f%e4%be%bf%e9%9a%be%e9%98%b4%e9%98%b3%e4%bf%b1%e8%99%9a%e7%ab%ad%e8%ba%ab%e4%bd%93%e5%88%99%e6%9e%af%e7%87%a5%e4%bd%86%e5%a4%b4%e6%b1%97%e5%87%ba%e5%89%82%e9%a2%88%e8%80%8c%e8%bf%98%e8%85%b9%e6%bb%a1%e5%be%ae%e5%96%98%e5%8f%a3%e5%b9%b2%e5%92%bd%e7%83%82%e6%88%96%e4%b8%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%be%bf%e4%b9%85%e5%88%99%e8%b0%b5%e8%af%ad%e7%94%9a%e8%80%85%e8%87%b3%e5%93%95%e6%89%8b%e8%b6%b3%e8%ba%81%e6%89%b0%e6%8d%bb%e8%a1%a3%e6%91%b8%e5%ba%8a%e5%b0%8f%e4%be%bf%e5%88%a9%e8%80%85%e5%85%b6%e4%ba%ba%e5%8f%af%e6%b2%bb\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e"},{"title":"辨太阳病脉证并治法中：一二三","date_published":"2025-06-09T09:45:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-24