核承气汤\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e一一九：「太阳病」不解，热结膀胱，其人如狂，血自下，下者愈；其外不解者，尚未可攻，当先解其外，外解已，但少腹急结者，仍可攻之，宜「桃核承气汤」。\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%80%e4%b9%9d%e5%a4%aa%e9%98%b3%e7%97%85%e4%b8%8d%e8%a7%a3%e7%83%ad%e7%bb%93%e8%86%80%e8%83%b1%e5%85%b6%e4%ba%ba%e5%a6%82%e7%8b%82%e8%a1%80%e8%87%aa%e4%b8%8b%e4%b8%8b%e8%80%85%e6%84%88%e5%85%b6%e5%a4%96%e4%b8%8d%e8%a7%a3%e8%80%85%e5%b0%9a%e6%9c%aa%e5%8f%af%e6%94%bb%e5%bd%93%e5%85%88%e8%a7%a3%e5%85%b6%e5%a4%96%e5%a4%96%e8%a7%a3%e5%b7%b2%e4%bd%86%e5%b0%91%e8%85%b9%e6%80%a5%e7%bb%93%e8%80%85%e4%bb%8d%e5%8f%af%e6%94%bb%e4%b9%8b%e5%ae%9c%e6%a1%83%e6%a0%b8%e6%89%bf%e6%b0%94%e6%b1%a4\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e"},{"title":"辨太阳病脉证并治法中：一一八","date_published":"2025-06-08T18:37:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-24T06:16:13Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-118/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-118/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"summary":"一一八：「伤寒」，十三日不解，过经，谵语者，以有热也，当以汤下之。若小便利者，大便当鞭。而反下利，脉调和者，知医以丸药下之，非其治也。若自下利者，脉微当厥，今反和者，知为内实也，「调味承气汤」主之。 ","content_html":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"一一八伤寒十三日不解过经谵语者以有热也当以汤下之若小便利者大便当鞭而反下利脉调和者知医以丸药下之非其治也若自下利者脉微当厥今反和者知为内实也调味承气汤主之\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e一一八：「伤寒」，十三日不解，过经，谵语者，以有热也，当以汤下之。若小便利者，大便当鞭。而反下利，脉调和者，知医以丸药下之，非其治也。若自下利者，脉微当厥，今反和者，知为内实也，「调味承气汤」主之。\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%80%e5%85%ab%e4%bc%a4%e5%af%92%e5%8d%81%e4%b8%89%e6%97%a5%e4%b8%8d%e8%a7%a3%e8%bf%87%e7%bb%8f%e8%b0%b5%e8%af%ad%e8%80%85%e4%bb%a5%e6%9c%89%e7%83%ad%e4%b9%9f%e5%bd%93%e4%bb%a5%e6%b1%a4%e4%b8%8b%e4%b9%8b%e8%8b%a5%e5%b0%8f%e4%be%bf%e5%88%a9%e8%80%85%e5%a4%a7%e4%be%bf%e5%bd%93%e9%9e%ad%e8%80%8c%e5%8f%8d%e4%b8%8b%e5%88%a9%e8%84%89%e8%b0%83%e5%92%8c%e8%80%85%e7%9f%a5%e5%8c%bb%e4%bb%a5%e4%b8%b8%e8%8d%af%e4%b8%8b%e4%b9%8b%e9%9d%9e%e5%85%b6%e6%b2%bb%e4%b9%9f%e8%8b%a5%e8%87%aa%e4%b8%8b%e5%88%a9%e8%80%85%e8%84%89%e5%be%ae%e5%bd%93%e5%8e%a5%e4%bb%8a%e5%8f%8d%e5%92%8c%e8%80%85%e7%9f%a5%e4%b8%ba%e5%86%85%e5%ae%9e%e4%b9%9f%e8%b0%83%e5%91%b3%e6%89%bf%e6%b0%94%e6%b1%a4%e4%b8%bb%e4%b9%8b\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e"},{"title":"辨太阳病脉证并治法中：一一七","date_published":"2025-06-08T18:14:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-24T06:16:13Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-117/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-117/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.webp"}],"summary":"一一七：「伤寒」十三日不解，胸胁满而呕，已而微下利，日晡所发潮热，此「柴胡证」，本不得利，今反利者，知医以药丸下之，非其治也。潮热者，实也，先宜「小柴胡汤」以解外，后以「柴胡加芒硝汤」主之。 ","content_html":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-element\" id=\"一一七伤寒十三日不解胸胁满而呕已而微下利日晡所发潮热此柴胡证本不得利今反利者知医以药丸下之非其治也潮热者实也先宜小柴胡汤以解外后以柴胡加芒硝汤主之\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e一一七：「伤寒」十三日不解，胸胁满而呕，已而微下利，日晡所发潮热，此「柴胡证」，本不得利，今反利者，知医以药丸下之，非其治也。潮热者，实也，先宜「小柴胡汤」以解外，后以「柴胡加芒硝汤」主之。\u003c/span\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%83%e4%bc%a4%e5%af%92%e5%8d%81%e4%b8%89%e6%97%a5%e4%b8%8d%e8%a7%a3%e8%83%b8%e8%83%81%e6%bb%a1%e8%80%8c%e5%91%95%e5%b7%b2%e8%80%8c%e5%be%ae%e4%b8%8b%e5%88%a9%e6%97%a5%e6%99%a1%e6%89%80%e5%8f%91%e6%bd%ae%e7%83%ad%e6%ad%a4%e6%9f%b4%e8%83%a1%e8%af%81%e6%9c%ac%e4%b8%8d%e5%be%97%e5%88%a9%e4%bb%8a%e5%8f%8d%e5%88%a9%e8%80%85%e7%9f%a5%e5%8c%bb%e4%bb%a5%e8%8d%af%e4%b8%b8%e4%b8%8b%e4%b9%8b%e9%9d%9e%e5%85%b6%e6%b2%bb%e4%b9%9f%e6%bd%ae%e7%83%ad%e8%80%85%e5%ae%9e%e4%b9%9f%e5%85%88%e5%ae%9c%e5%b0%8f%e6%9f%b4%e8%83%a1%e6%b1%a4%e4%bb%a5%e8%a7%a3%e5%a4%96%e5%90%8e%e4%bb%a5%e6%9f%b4%e8%83%a1%e5%8a%a0%e8%8a%92%e7%a1%9d%e6%b1%a4%e4%b8%bb%e4%b9%8b\" class=\"heading-mark\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/h2\u003e"},{"title":"辨太阳病脉证并治法中：一一六","date_published":"2025-06-08T17:59:22&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-09-24T06:16:13Z","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-116/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/shanghanlun-116/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","u